## Product roadmap

This repo carries a **product roadmap home** at `<home-path>` — the strategy vault holding
*why we build, how we'll know it worked, and the work in flight*. Read `<home-path>/AGENTS.md`
for its taxonomy and folder conventions, and `<home-path>/backlog/AGENTS.md` for the work-item
schema.

Operate on it with the bundled **`/roadmap`** skill (`.claude/skills/roadmap/`): it sharpens a
vision into a measurable bet, or files a backlog item. The home is **read** by `/intent` to
ground a PRD's *why* and **appended** by `/intent` (register-back) and `/evaluate-pr`
(follow-up filing). The build harness never builds from it — it lives outside any `prds/` and
carries no sentinels.
